      "content": "While propranolol can help calm physical symptoms of anxiety like a racing heart, I would advise caution. Taking a pill without consulting your doctor, especially considering your asthma, is not a good idea. Propranolol can exacerbate asthma symptoms by causing bronchospasm. It's recommended to speak with your doctor or a medical professional for personalized advice on managing your anxiety and accessing suitable medication for your specific condition.",
