      "content": "i know, i should probably ask, but i really can't get a doctor on the phone tonight and i'm spiraling. my asthma is super mild and i usually just use a rescue inhaler if i feel anything, so it shouldn't be a huge issue, right? how much would be a safe amount to take just to take the edge off for an hour? i just need to not look like a wreck during this presentation.",
